WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.737
THIS RIGHT HERE...
- YEAH.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.174
- THIS GOES OUT
TO ALL OUR FALLEN HOMIES, YO.

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.043
COME ON.
- HEY, YO, REAL TALK.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.844
- ALL RIGHT?

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:17.350
[liquid splashing]

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.587
- I MEAN,

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.123
IT JUST SEEMS LIKE A WASTE.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:27.293
RIGHT?

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:30.229
DOES THAT MAKE ME A [bleep]?

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:31.798
OKAY, I'M A [bleep].
OKAY, I'M A [bleep].

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.466
I'M SORRY.
I'M A BIG OL' [bleep].

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.968
- LET'S GO.
- I'M S--OKAY, HERE--

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:38.772
FOR OUR HOMIES.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.647
- COME ON, MAN.
- POUR OUT YOUR DAMN BEER!

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.683
- OKAY, OKAY, FINE, FINE.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.422
GLUG, GLUG, GLUG.
GLUG, GLUG, GLUG--

00:00:56.455 --> 00:00:58.024
- NO, COME ON, MAN.

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.259
HEY, MAN, YOU GOT YOUR THUMB
IN THERE, MAN.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.562
YOU NEED TO RESPECT
OUR HOMIES.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:05.098
- JEEZ, OKAY.
OKAY, OKAY.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:06.833
FOR THE HOMIES.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.935
- WHA--
- [bleep], A TRASH BEER?

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.205
- WHAT? COME ON--
HEY, BEER IS BEER!

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.674
THE--JEEZ, I CANNOT WIN
ON THIS.

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.342
- WHAT?
- FINE.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:19.645
I'M NOT ON BOARD WITH THIS,
BUT I'LL DO IT.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:23.449
[liquid splashing]

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:24.851
- HEY, MAN,
WHAT YOU DOIN'?

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:27.420
- OH--OH, REALLY?
WHAT, THAT--THAT DON'T COUNT?

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:29.388
- AW, HEY, PUT THAT--
THAT'S NOT FOR--

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:30.756
AW, MAN.

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:31.958
- [sighs]

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.526
IT'S MORE OF A SYMBOL
THAN A GESTURE.

00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:35.428
SOMEBODY BACK ME UP ON THAT.
RIGHT?

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.797
- HEY, MAN, THAT'S
DISRESPECTFUL RIGHT THERE.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.565
YOU JUST DO IT.
- FINE.

00:01:39.598 --> 00:01:41.100
FINE!
I'LL POUR IT OUT!

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:44.137
I'LL WASTE
THE DAMN BEER THEN!

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:52.178
[groans]

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.547
YOU KNOW, I-I'M J--
I'M JUST NOT A WASTER.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:57.783
YOU KNOW, I SAVE EVERYTHING.
MAN, JAMAL KNOWS.

00:01:57.816 --> 00:02:00.086
IF HE EAT A PIECE OF PIZZA
AND DON'T EAT THE CRUST,

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:01.187
I EAT THE CRUST.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.456
- IF WE DO
A DRIVE-BY SHOOTING,

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.024
I WILL GO BACK
FOR THE SHELL CASES.

00:02:05.057 --> 00:02:06.993
NOT TO HIDE
THE EVIDENCE,

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.762
BUT BECAUSE YOU
CAN RECYCLE THOSE.

00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:12.698
THEY HAVE VALUE, MAN,
JUST LIKE THIS BEER.

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.800
I CAN'T WASTE NOTHIN',
Y'ALL.

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:18.471
IT'S PHYSICALLY IMPOSSIBLE
FOR ME TO WASTE THIS.

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:21.307
I CAN'T DO IT.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:25.345
JAMAL, CAN YOU POUR IT OUT
FOR ME?

00:02:28.747 --> 00:02:31.517
- OH, MAN.
COME ON, MAN.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.518
- I MEAN, IT'S NOT
GONNA BRING 'EM BACK.

00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:33.686
- STUPID.

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:35.722
- IT'S NOT
GONNA BRING 'EM BACK.

